    "body": "I think Step 17.6. of [StructuredSerializeInternal](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/structured-data.html#structuredserializeinternal) explicitly allows us to serialize additional data:\n\n> User agents should attach a serialized representation of any interesting accompanying data which are not yet specified, notably the stack property, to serialized.",
